  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Arcane Archer initiation reward (roadmap: arcane-archer-quest). Modest +3-tier class item per the roadmap notes: Concentration +3, Spot +3, Listen +3, no combat stats (no AB/damage -- keeps clear of forge caps) -- the marksman's-senses trio mirroring the pale talisman's lore trio and the unlit boots' stealth trio. Created by q_arc_finish; one per character (prestigedb stage 3 never resets)."
  },
